'''Rivalry''' (ライバル宣言, ''Raibaru Sengen'', '''Rival Declaration''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Worker Cat Start Level UP (Sm): Worker Cat's initial level starts with +1.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Rivalry|Worker Start Level Up (Sm)|Red Riding Mina|Valkyrie Cat|jpname=ライバル宣言}}
}}

==Trivia==
*The name of this Cat Combo is a reference to [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Crimson Mina]]'s description, which describes how she is very popular with the Cats but hasn't quite reached [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie]]'s level.
**Crimson Mina's Japanese description confirms that Mina "says Valkyrie is her current rival."

